MATCH.WARN.1
1 1 2 Mar 03 14:21:43 2025
"Warning: MOSFET matching performance degradation at least by 3X may appear when violating PO.DN.16, PO.R.28 or MOS array matching rule (AN.R.80.2m and AN.R.79.2m). Note: CAD layer MATCHING (205,8), ANARRAY_H (255,20) or ANARRAY_M (255,21) are required to flag mismatch related rules checking in MOS matching pairs. In case of absence of MATCHING (205,8), ANARRAY_H (255,20) and ANARRAY_M (255,21) in MOS matching pairs, MOS array matching rule like PO.DN.16, PO.R.28, AN.R.80.2m, AN.R.79.2m or DFM will not be flagged. Customers can bypass this warning message if they ensure no circuits concerning MOS mismatch in the sign off flow of circuit design. DRC only flags this warning in chip level"
 SELECT -interact CHIPx MATCHING_ARRAY -not MATCH.WARN.1:L266086
